Subject: mt7996: serialize WTBL windows and apply retail TID0 BA adaptation

Keep group selection and data operations under one host spinlock. Bound
retail index transitions by the firmware-negotiated initial index, retain
other TIDs, invalidate sessions on BA lifecycle/SER and restore on disable.
No firmware binary is replaced. Hardware validation is still required.

